        <mxCell id="pyPSE6TSPybAyZzcW5U1-47" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;rounded=0;spacingTop=2;" value="&lt;p&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(32, 33, 34); background-color: rgb(248, 249, 250);&quot;&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;CodeRegression.src.Operators - directory, where we have general functions to build methods (utils) and components to build algorithm pipelines (methods)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(32, 33, 34); background-color: rgb(248, 249, 250);&quot;&gt;•&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 100%;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;CodeRegression.src.Operators.Utils - directory, where we have general functions that we use in multiple methods&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(32, 33, 34); background-color: rgb(248, 249, 250);&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 100%;&quot;&gt;• CodeRegression.src.Operators.Utils.some_utility - classified general functions, for example to search for literals (public)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(32, 33, 34); background-color: rgb(248, 249, 250);&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 100%;&quot;&gt;• CodeRegression.src.Operators.Methods - directory, where we have methods to construct custom pipelines from&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(32, 33, 34); background-color: rgb(248, 249, 250);&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 100%;&quot;&gt;• CodeRegression.src.Operators.Methods.some_method - simply name of the method that implemented with various algorithms&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(248, 249, 250); color: rgb(32, 33, 34);&quot;&gt;(public)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(32, 33, 34); background-color: rgb(248, 249, 250);&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 100%;&quot;&gt;• CodeRegression.src.Operators.Methods.some_method.some_algo - simply implementation of the given method with specific algo.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(248, 249, 250); color: rgb(32, 33, 34);&quot;&gt;We MUST guarantee that every algo takes and outputs the same set of params (public)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="290" width="500" x="5" y="420" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pyPSE6TSPybAyZzcW5U1-48" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; caret-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(236, 236, 236); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(32, 33, 34); background-color: rgb(248, 249, 250);&quot;&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;some_algo.core - core structures and its functions (private or static)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(248, 249, 250); color: rgb(32, 33, 34);&quot;&gt;•&amp;nbsp; some_algo.&lt;/span&gt;operations - all functions that exclusively some_algo uses. (private or static)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(248, 249, 250); color: rgb(32, 33, 34);&quot;&gt;• some_algo.&lt;/span&gt;utils - general functions that doesn&#39;t classify to core and operations, it is only for inner subalgos (&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;private and static&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="120" width="560" x="10" y="960" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
